
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.012895546 0.017064647 -0.065347) to (41.035104 40.609919 42.221347)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
